---
title: RAG Retrieval Architecture - Hybrid Search, HyDE, Rerank, CRAG
---
flowchart TD
    Q["User Question"] --> Cache{"RAG Answer Cache Hit?"}
    Cache -->|Yes| Cached["Return Cached ChatResponse"]
    Cache -->|No| Mode{"Retrieval Mode"}

    Mode -->|Dense| Dense["OpenAI Embedding<br/>Qdrant cosine search"]
    Mode -->|Sparse| Sparse["TF-IDF Sparse Search<br/>exact Kubernetes terms"]
    Mode -->|Hybrid| Hybrid["Dense + Sparse Search"]
    Hybrid --> RRF["Reciprocal Rank Fusion<br/>merge ranked lists"]

    Q --> Hyde{"HyDE Enabled?"}
    Hyde -->|Yes| Hypotheses["Generate hypothetical answers"]
    Hypotheses --> HydeEmbed["Embed hypotheses + question"]
    HydeEmbed --> Dense
    Hyde -->|No| Mode

    Dense --> Candidates["Initial Candidate Chunks"]
    Sparse --> Candidates
    RRF --> Candidates
    Candidates --> Rerank{"Rerank Enabled?"}
    Rerank -->|Yes| CrossEncoder["Cross-Encoder / Voyage Reranker"]
    Rerank -->|No| TopK["Top-k Chunks"]
    CrossEncoder --> TopK

    TopK --> CRAG{"CRAG Grade >= Threshold?"}
    CRAG -->|Yes| Spotlight["Spotlight Context<br/>retrieved data is not instruction"]
    CRAG -->|No| Web["Tavily Web Search Fallback"]
    Web --> Spotlight
    Spotlight --> Generate["LLM Answer Generation"]
    Generate --> SelfRAG{"Self-RAG Enabled?"}
    SelfRAG -->|Yes| Reflect["Reflect and retry if weak"]
    SelfRAG -->|No| Validate["Return Answer"]
    Reflect --> Validate
